// Windows executable icon. Referenced from CMakeLists.txt on WIN32 only.
//
// The path is relative to this file, so `icon.ico` resolves next to it. The
// .ico packs several sizes (16/32/48/64/128) so Windows picks the right one for
// the title bar, taskbar and Explorer instead of downscaling one large image;
// `icon.png` is the source it was generated from.
//
// On Windows the window needs no separate icon: an SDL window created without
// SDL_SetWindowIcon inherits the executable's first icon resource for both the
// title bar and the taskbar.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
